// 1-27: one of everything, twice.
id l1-27
name 1-27 ZIPPER
tagline one of everything, twice.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor pull yank
mechanics current:14 plank:13 pull:4 anchor:14 yank:3 hack:1 capacitor:3 secret:2
new -
portion 4 a secret wall 8 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 5.3 hop 4 one-way planks over current (heights 1131)
portion 5 a low ceiling 10 long over a current notch
portion 6 capacitor gate 22 tiles away
portion 6.5 hop 4 pull ports (mid, low, mid, high), 7-8-7 apart, over current
portion 7.1 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 26 gap (ceiling, ceiling anchors)
portion 5.6 zip 3 anchors (mid, ceiling, mid), 8-8 apart, over current
portion 6 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 18 gap (mid anchors)
portion 5.5 two anchors up to the top lane
portion 7.3 capacitor gate 24 tiles away, current notch on the way
portion 6.6 drive a rail 12 long, swing a 22 gap (mid, mid anchors)
portion 4.6 hack port opens a gate, 4-wide current beyond
portion 7.8 capacitor gate 26 tiles away, current notch on the way
portion 5.3 hop 4 one-way planks over current (heights 2311)
portion 6.5 zip 4 anchors (mid, mid, high, ceiling), 8-8-9 apart, over current
portion 5.6 hop 5 one-way planks over current (heights 23121)
hardness 5.9
map
